From 374a6b24f2f2b52fc131417d8d0e4e78900f7a5d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yhyang201 <yhyang201@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 22:59:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/38] Qwen3.8-27B Model Support

Squashed from radixark/sglang-qwen38-27b#1:

- Start Qwen3.8-27B model support
- Cast cu_seqlens to int64 in the SM120/SM100 GDN prefill path
- Widen swapAB dispatch range in SM120 fp8 blockwise GEMM
- Fix DSpark draft logits when the target lm_head is quantized
- Fuse SiLU+mul with NVFP4 down_proj input quantization for dense MLP
- Add SM120 M=1 fp8 GEMV fast path for per-tensor ModelOpt FP8 linear
- GDN: support the non-power-of-two v/k head ratio 3 in the fused contiguous split
- GDN: default FlashInfer prefill on SM90 and accept bf16 state pools on SM120
- Add Hopper single-token bf16 GEMV as a bf16-gemm-backend option

Co-authored-by: Jimmy Shong <69131491+Jiminator@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-authored-by: Brayden Zhong <brayden.zhong@radixark.ai>
Co-authored-by: BBuf <1182563586@qq.com>
